caption: GATES Setting Rules — Related GATES Technology
technology-rule: related-gates-technology

Power armor, battlesuits, and mechs are normally equipment rather than cybernetics unless permanently integrated into the body. Chems are temporary pharmaceutical buffs governed by the GATES Chems document. Altered Soldier Traditions may provide cinematic permissions, improved integration, or exceptional performance, but do not retroactively make ordinary cyberware supernatural or superscience.
